      "title": "orrery",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## RefMods through the language (#9, #10, #30)\n\nThe A/B/C tour, steered by the CAST alone: `SALON (refmod orrery_abc_salon)` puts the salon's RefMod on the clips that name SALON (the first and the last), from 35 % of sampling on, at strength 1. Change it in the template and Generate again: `at 0.5`, `from 0%`, `, global`, or the defaults on the `refmods:` line.\n\n**Orrery RefMods** sits between Reference to Video's conditioning and Orrery Continue, with the Orrery Prompt's picks: it loads the RefMods from `models/refmods` (ComfyUI-H3RefMods pack) and puts each on the conditioning with its strength and start. No Load or Apply RefMod nodes.\n\nGenerate ×4 renders the four clips into `output/abc_refmods/`. Make `orrery_abc_salon` first: `orrery_abc_make_salon` (the stills are A's first clip, frames 0, 60, 120, 180)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## RefMods through the language (#9, #10, #30)\n\nThe A/B/C tour, steered by the CAST alone: `SALON (refmod orrery_abc_salon)` puts the salon's RefMod on the clips that name SALON (the first and the last), from 35 % of sampling on, at strength 1. Change it in the template and Generate again: `at 0.5`, `from 0%`, `, global`, or the defaults on the `refmods:` line.\n\n**Orrery RefMods** sits between Reference to Video's conditioning and Orrery Continue, with the Orrery Prompt's picks: it loads the RefMods from `models/refmods` (ComfyUI-H3RefMods pack) and puts each on the conditioning with its strength and start. No Load or Apply RefMod nodes.\n\nGenerate ×4 renders the four clips into `output/abc_refmods/`. Make `orrery_abc_salon` first: `orrery_abc_make_salon` (the stills are A's first clip, frames 0, 60, 120, 180)."
      },
